    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beer Runner</strong>, you'll run, jump, and fight your way through 6 different levels with enemies, npcs, epic bosses, and a lot of beer. The more you drink, the harder it gets...\u00a0Each beer will shake the camera more and it will even flips your controls, and turns simple jumps into chaotic challenges where survival is half skill, half comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight platforming action with fast-paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique beer mechanic: drink for fun, and suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against challenging enemies and crazy bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique levels, each with its own atmosphere and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master (especially after a few beers)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, battling bizarre bosses, or just trying to stay upright, <strong>Beer Runner</strong> delivers a fun, chaotic platformer where every beer makes things a little more ridiculous.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beer Runner</strong>, you'll run, jump, and fight your way through 6 different levels with enemies, npcs, epic bosses, and a lot of beer. The more you drink, the harder it gets...\u00a0Each beer will shake the camera more and it will even flips your controls, and turns simple jumps into chaotic challenges where survival is half skill, half comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight platforming action with fast-paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique beer mechanic: drink for fun, and suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against challenging enemies and crazy bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique levels, each with its own atmosphere and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master (especially after a few beers)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, battling bizarre bosses, or just trying to stay upright, <strong>Beer Runner</strong> delivers a fun, chaotic platformer where every beer makes things a little more ridiculous.</p>",
    "short_description": "Run through wild and crazy pubs, jump across insane platforms, and drink so much beer as you can! The bartender refused to give you free beer.. time to teach him a lesson and become the one and only Beer Runner!",
